msgstr "Buang Arahan"

#: configdialog.cpp:338
msgid "Click here to set the command to be executed"
msgstr "Klik di sini untuk tentukan arahan untuk dilaksanakan"

#: configdialog.cpp:339
msgid "<new command>"
msgstr "<new command>"

#: configdialog.cpp:361
msgid "Click here to set the regexp"
msgstr "Klik sini untuk tetapkan regexp"

#: configdialog.cpp:362
msgid "<new action>"
msgstr "<new action>"

#: configdialog.cpp:402
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Lanjutan"

#: configdialog.cpp:419
msgid "D&isable Actions for Windows of Type WM_CLASS"
msgstr "Mat&ikan Aksi untuk Tetingkap Jenis WM_CLASS"

#: configdialog.cpp:422
msgid ""
"<qt>This lets you specify windows in which klipper should<br>not invoke "
"\"actions\". Use<center><b>xprop | grep WM_CLASS</b></center>in a terminal "
"to find out the WM_CLASS of a window.<br>Next, click on the window you want "
"to examine. The<br>first string it outputs after the equal sign is the "
"one<br>you need to enter here.</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Ini akan membolehkan anda menentukan tetingkap mana Klipper <br>tidak panggil "
"\"actions\". Guna<center><b>xprop | grep WM_CLASS</b></center>di dalam terminal "
"untuk cari WM_CLASS bagi tetingkap.<br>Kemudian, klik pada tetingkap yang anda "
"ingin periksa. <br>Anda perlu letak rentetan pertama output selepas tanda 'sama dengan' "
"<br>di sini.</qt>"

